description: Cinema monorepo — the rules that are not visible in the code.
globs: "*.ts, *.tsx, *.html, *.css, *.js, *.jsx, package.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

`CLAUDE.md` at the repo root is the full brief. In short:

- **Bun is the package manager and script runner** (`bun install`, `bun run dev`, `bun test`).
  The web app is built by **Vite** — do not migrate it to `Bun.serve` or HTML imports.
- **Colour, radius, shadow and font values live only in `packages/design-tokens/tokens.json`.**
  `bun run tokens` regenerates the web CSS, `CinemaTokens.swift`, `CinemaTokens.kt` and
  `cinema_tokens.xml`, and syncs them into the forks. Never hand-edit a generated file, and never
  put a hex value in a component. `docs/DESIGN.md` has the design rules.
- **Never move code between `apps/ios` (MPL-2.0) and `apps/android` (GPLv3)**, and never copy from
  `jellyfin-web` (GPLv3) into `apps/web`. `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` § 6.
- **Everything reaches Jellyfin through the relative base path `/jf`**, and only
  `apps/web/src/lib/jellyfin/` imports `@jellyfin/sdk`. `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
